# Publish target for this repository's own scope. The package is public and
# lives on the official registry, whatever mirror the machine uses by default
# (a company Verdaccio/Nexus is usually a read proxy, not a publish target).
@shudingbo:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/

# Authentication is never committed:
#   - locally:      npm login   (or a granular token in ~/.npmrc)
#   - GitHub Actions: the NPM_TOKEN repository secret, or npm Trusted Publishing
# No _authToken line belongs in this file.
